OL,3,GNEWSA'The internet's a less whimsical
OL,4,Aplace' - YouTuber Jacksepticeye
OL,5,Abranches out
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe world's changed a lot since Sean
OL,8,FMcLoughlin, better known to 31 million
OL,9,Fsubscribers as Jacksepticeye, began
OL,10,Fmaking YouTube videos.
OL,12,FHe started uploading in 2012, in what
OL,13,Fmany people consider to be the
OL,14,Fplatform's "golden age" when vlogging,
OL,15,Fvideo game playthroughs and comedy
OL,16,Fescapism were all the rage.
OL,18,FLike many in the content creation
OL,19,Fspace, he's been branching out in
OL,20,Frecent years, taking more acting jobs
OL,21,Fand getting involved in film
OL,22,Fproduction.
OL,23,APub: 29-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
